  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hi! World builder and events coordinator here. I'd like to request that we be able to add co-owners to our private worlds so they can open instances from within vrchat without relying on the website. When my group's fellow event coordinators open an instance from the website for one of my private worlds, they're unable to link it to an event on the calendar at this time. It seems that only the world owner is able to do this by going through the in-game UI?\n\nAlternatively, can we set it up so it's an option to connect the calendar event to the instance on the website?",
